WEBVTT

00:01.459 --> 00:04.087
SAKAMOTO'S

00:06.005 --> 00:08.508
I'm still exhausted
from the fight at the Lab.

00:09.718 --> 00:11.177
My body feels stiff.

00:12.721 --> 00:15.348
Were my pork buns always this heavy?

00:15.432 --> 00:19.060
We'd be in trouble
if a hit man attacked us right now.

00:22.397 --> 00:24.232
There's only one thing for it.

00:25.984 --> 00:27.902
IKOI NO YU
NATURAL HOT SPRINGS

00:27.986 --> 00:29.904
- Let's all take a bath together!
- This is...

00:29.988 --> 00:31.406
Big bath, big bath!

00:31.489 --> 00:32.657
...a bathhouse?

02:05.667 --> 02:08.711
BATHHOUSE MODE

02:08.795 --> 02:10.964
Mr. Sakamoto, this isn't safe.

02:11.589 --> 02:15.009
I must be too tired.
It's affecting my mind-reading power.

02:15.593 --> 02:17.428
<i>You don't get it, do you?</i>

02:18.096 --> 02:20.640
<i>Knowing when to rest
so you can stay at your best</i>

02:20.723 --> 02:23.059
<i>is part of being first-class.</i>

02:24.686 --> 02:26.729
<i>In a sense, this is a high-priority task.</i>

02:26.813 --> 02:27.939
RELAX

02:28.022 --> 02:28.857
<i>Come on.</i>

02:33.069 --> 02:36.156
I've actually never been
to a public bathhouse.

02:36.239 --> 02:38.616
Really? How unusual.

02:38.700 --> 02:41.077
The bathtub here is super big.

02:41.161 --> 02:44.205
Really? Super big? Could I swim in it?

02:44.998 --> 02:47.292
I'm so excited to go in!

02:47.375 --> 02:48.209
<i>Calm down.</i>

02:48.793 --> 02:50.211
DUCKIE

02:51.963 --> 02:54.632
<i>It's so slow at this time on a weekday.</i>

02:54.716 --> 02:58.469
<i>I knew I shouldn't have come back
to work at my folks' place.</i>

02:59.137 --> 03:01.347
Four adults and one child, please.

03:01.431 --> 03:02.640
Oh, sure.

03:06.019 --> 03:07.812
<i>Why do I recognize him?</i>

03:08.396 --> 03:10.523
Oh no, I forgot towels.

03:10.607 --> 03:13.151
Mr. Sakamoto, did you bring towels?

03:13.234 --> 03:14.068
No.

03:15.695 --> 03:17.363
<i>Could he be...</i>

03:17.989 --> 03:19.073
With towels, please.

03:19.157 --> 03:22.410
Right. Towels for each of you, so...

03:22.493 --> 03:25.580
Let's see... Your total comes to 3,300 yen.

03:26.915 --> 03:28.166
Right, thank you.

03:29.918 --> 03:31.252
One moment, please.

03:36.299 --> 03:38.801
Let's go, Daddy.

03:39.344 --> 03:41.346
<i>I knew it. That's him.</i>

03:41.429 --> 03:43.723
<i>Taro Sakamoto, the legendary hit man.</i>

03:43.806 --> 03:44.641
Make it snappy.

03:46.851 --> 03:50.855
<i>I never thought a petty hit man like me
would ever come in contact with him,</i>

03:51.522 --> 03:53.399
<i>let alone while working at my folks'.</i>

03:53.483 --> 03:54.734
YUTARO, 24
AMATEUR HIT MAN

03:54.817 --> 03:56.027
BOUNTY: 1 BILLION

03:56.110 --> 03:58.279
<i>And his bounty is one billion yen?</i>

03:58.363 --> 04:01.741
<i>This is my chance to make a name for--</i>

04:03.368 --> 04:04.202
The towels?

04:08.206 --> 04:09.415
Enjoy!

04:15.797 --> 04:19.050
I feel like this experience
will bring us closer, don't you?

04:19.133 --> 04:20.843
Don't read too deep into this.

04:22.553 --> 04:26.015
<i>There's no way I'm gonna get stuck
running the family business.</i>

04:26.099 --> 04:31.229
<i>If I can just kill the legendary hit man,
the fame and the one billion yen are mine.</i>

04:32.772 --> 04:34.232
<i>I gotta do this.</i>

04:35.233 --> 04:36.943
<i>I'm gonna do this.</i>

04:41.447 --> 04:45.368
Man, this is awesome. So liberating!

04:45.451 --> 04:46.619
<i>Feels good.</i>

04:46.703 --> 04:49.289
<i>He's completely vulnerable.</i>

04:49.372 --> 04:52.458
<i>I can do it. I'm sure I can.</i>

04:54.460 --> 04:56.045
HIGH POWER
HYPER JET BATH

04:56.129 --> 04:58.548
Look, Mr. Sakamoto, a jet bath.

04:58.631 --> 04:59.674
Let's try it.

04:59.757 --> 05:00.591
Sure.

05:03.303 --> 05:06.431
I've never tried a special bath like this.

05:08.391 --> 05:10.393
This feels amazing!

05:10.893 --> 05:12.186
<i>It's a bit weak.</i>

05:12.270 --> 05:13.229
You think?

05:17.025 --> 05:22.155
<i>This is the exact scenario I had in mind
when I set up gimmicks in these baths.</i>

05:22.238 --> 05:23.865
Look, Mr. Sakamoto,

05:24.365 --> 05:26.576
there's a "high power" button over here.

05:31.497 --> 05:34.167
<i>Both of you, die!</i>

05:51.392 --> 05:55.563
That's what jet baths are like?
How dangerous.

05:55.646 --> 05:59.108
- Whoa, it's like a fountain.
- Daddy, can I try?

05:59.192 --> 06:01.027
Sure, when you grow up.

06:01.110 --> 06:02.987
Let's go see.

06:04.238 --> 06:05.948
<i>How's that for power?</i>

06:06.032 --> 06:08.951
<i>It's strong enough
to destroy a three-ton truck.</i>

06:09.994 --> 06:12.789
<i>Now, where's Sakamoto been blown--</i>

06:15.416 --> 06:16.501
<i>That feels good.</i>

06:17.376 --> 06:18.920
Wow, Mr. Sakamoto!

06:19.003 --> 06:20.838
You're hardcore even when resting!

06:20.922 --> 06:23.132
<i>What the heck?</i>

06:23.216 --> 06:25.468
<i>What kind of mass is packed into his body?</i>

06:32.058 --> 06:33.684
Let's go to the sauna.

06:33.768 --> 06:35.728
What's a sauna?

06:38.564 --> 06:42.485
<i>Yes, yes, yes.
Like a moth flying into a flame.</i>

06:42.568 --> 06:44.487
<i>I've got him now.</i>

06:44.570 --> 06:46.239
BENEFITS OF A SAUNA

06:46.823 --> 06:48.908
It's pretty hot in here.

06:48.991 --> 06:50.576
The temperature's a bit low.

06:50.660 --> 06:51.702
You think?

06:52.328 --> 06:55.998
Oh, it says we can pour water on these
to heat up the room.

07:00.962 --> 07:02.004
<i>Take this.</i>

07:12.473 --> 07:14.642
What's with this heat?!

07:17.854 --> 07:19.939
This is what saunas are like?

07:20.022 --> 07:22.608
<i>It's hot enough
to cause spontaneous combustion.</i>

07:22.692 --> 07:24.360
<i>You'll burn to death.</i>

07:26.529 --> 07:27.572
Just right.

07:28.865 --> 07:32.201
<i>What? How thick is his body fat?</i>

07:32.285 --> 07:35.455
Yeah... Yeah, it is.

07:38.708 --> 07:42.628
Compared to training as a hit man,
this is nothing.

07:42.712 --> 07:45.214
Right, Mr. Sakamoto?

07:45.298 --> 07:47.133
Hey, there's a bonfire.

07:47.216 --> 07:49.135
Daddy, can I go in?

07:49.218 --> 07:51.053
Sure, when you grow up.

07:54.599 --> 07:57.477
Oh my, did he get dizzy in the sauna?

07:57.560 --> 08:00.062
Young fellows these days are so wimpy.

08:00.938 --> 08:02.565
Ah, a cold bath.

08:02.648 --> 08:05.568
<i>If the heat won't do it,
how about the cold?</i>

08:10.781 --> 08:11.949
Wha...

08:12.033 --> 08:13.659
Is it... broken?

08:13.743 --> 08:14.952
<i>It's a bit too warm.</i>

08:16.787 --> 08:19.790
It's all frozen. We can skate on it!

08:22.084 --> 08:24.504
<i>How about this, then?</i>

08:27.590 --> 08:28.549
<i>Feels good.</i>

08:30.551 --> 08:31.928
It's a waterfall!

08:32.553 --> 08:33.471
Awesome!

08:35.264 --> 08:36.224
<i>Rejuvenating.</i>

08:36.307 --> 08:37.141
<i>Shit!</i>

08:37.225 --> 08:38.100
<i>Too warm.</i>

08:38.184 --> 08:39.435
<i>- How?
- Feels good.</i>

08:39.519 --> 08:40.645
<i>- Why?
- Rejuvenating.</i>

08:40.728 --> 08:42.647
<i>- Why won't he die?
- Too warm. Feels good.</i>

08:42.730 --> 08:45.316
<i>- How is that possible?
- Rejuvenating. Feels good.</i>

08:48.903 --> 08:51.072
You were in there for a while, honey.

08:54.825 --> 08:57.370
Hmm? Shin's dead.

09:02.792 --> 09:04.835
Daddy, can we get ice cream?

09:04.919 --> 09:06.504
Sure, when you grow up.

09:06.587 --> 09:07.880
You're no fun!

09:12.385 --> 09:13.511
<i>Damn it.</i>

09:13.594 --> 09:16.681
<i>I now know why he's the legendary hit man,
Taro Sakamoto!</i>

09:16.764 --> 09:19.642
<i>I can't even picture killing him.</i>

09:20.184 --> 09:21.894
Daddy, let's play ping-pong.

09:25.022 --> 09:27.108
Wow, Lu, you're so good!

09:27.191 --> 09:28.317
Not bad, Lu.

09:28.401 --> 09:29.944
Same to you, Mr. Manager.

09:30.903 --> 09:33.614
<i>I didn't want the life
my parents picked out for me.</i>

09:33.698 --> 09:36.117
<i>I rebelled for the sake of rebelling.</i>

09:36.200 --> 09:39.161
Stop making excuses
and take over the bathhouse!

09:39.245 --> 09:41.872
No! I'm gonna be a hit man.

09:42.748 --> 09:44.625
You can't be a hit man!

09:44.709 --> 09:46.502
You're not even that strong!

09:46.586 --> 09:48.671
Come back here! Yutaro!

09:51.257 --> 09:56.178
<i>I haven't achieved anything in life.
How could I kill Sakamoto, of all people?</i>

09:56.262 --> 09:58.639
Well, look who it is. Yutaro!

09:58.723 --> 10:01.142
Long time no see.

10:01.225 --> 10:03.394
Say something, you idiot.

10:03.477 --> 10:05.104
Oh... Yeah...

10:05.688 --> 10:06.981
What's up?

10:07.064 --> 10:09.483
Didn't you leave town
saying you'd make it big?

10:09.567 --> 10:12.194
But you ended up working for your folks!

10:13.946 --> 10:15.906
It's none of your business!

10:15.990 --> 10:20.119
Who do you think you're yelling at?
We're customers, remember?

10:24.957 --> 10:28.169
Don't whimper, you creep.

10:28.252 --> 10:31.881
You've always been such a coward.

10:33.841 --> 10:36.761
It's not like you'd ever get a proper job,

10:36.844 --> 10:40.723
so you might as well take over
this bath-shack.

10:41.807 --> 10:45.436
Don't insult my dad's bathhouse.

10:46.062 --> 10:48.773
Look at this place. It's falling apart.

10:48.856 --> 10:49.940
Isn't it, Mon?

10:50.024 --> 10:51.567
A shitty bath-shack!

11:00.326 --> 11:01.494
Ping...

11:01.577 --> 11:03.079
Pong!

11:06.499 --> 11:08.292
Yokkun! Yokkun!

11:08.376 --> 11:11.087
What the hell did you do to him?

11:11.170 --> 11:12.171
I didn't do any--

11:12.254 --> 11:14.090
Who do you think you are?

11:35.152 --> 11:36.195
Here you go.

11:37.238 --> 11:41.200
You... You must've known all along.

11:42.243 --> 11:45.037
You figured out that I was trying to

11:45.121 --> 11:48.207
- kill you--
- The baths were great. Very innovative.

11:48.999 --> 11:50.084
That's all.

11:54.130 --> 11:56.298
The hot spring was great!

11:56.382 --> 11:58.300
- Let's come again.
- Yeah!

11:58.384 --> 12:00.302
Shin is such a wimp.

12:00.386 --> 12:02.555
How could he get this dizzy?

12:04.932 --> 12:08.144
It's been years since I've been
complimented by anyone.

12:09.395 --> 12:12.815
And by the legendary hit man, no less.

12:16.485 --> 12:17.611
Hi, Dad.

12:18.279 --> 12:19.321
I've been thinking,

12:19.905 --> 12:21.866
and I think it's time I took over.

12:22.867 --> 12:23.701
What?

12:24.368 --> 12:25.244
Yeah.

12:25.327 --> 12:27.955
I'm done being a hit man.

12:28.497 --> 12:30.916
I've finally figured out it's not for me.

12:32.251 --> 12:33.586
Huh? "No"?

12:34.295 --> 12:36.422
I take too much for granted?

12:36.505 --> 12:37.339
Right.

12:38.424 --> 12:39.258
I see...

12:40.926 --> 12:42.428
THE NEXT DAY

12:42.511 --> 12:45.639
My body feels even stiffer.

12:45.723 --> 12:48.934
I didn't know bathhouses were so tough.

12:49.018 --> 12:50.644
Shin, you look funny!

13:00.779 --> 13:02.198
So this is Japan.

13:02.740 --> 13:04.450
I can only hope she's safe.

13:07.453 --> 13:10.706
We must go pick her up at once.

13:11.957 --> 13:14.335
GIFTO

13:14.418 --> 13:19.340
Going to the bathhouse
made me feel even worse.

13:19.423 --> 13:21.550
Look, Shin.

13:22.801 --> 13:24.637
One's normal cola.

13:24.720 --> 13:27.515
The other is my special-blend cola.

13:27.598 --> 13:29.391
No reading minds.

13:29.475 --> 13:32.853
Huh? What the heck is a "special blend"?

13:35.314 --> 13:36.273
This one.

13:39.276 --> 13:41.237
Yay! You're paying today.

13:41.320 --> 13:43.948
What a dumb game. How did I fall for that?

13:44.031 --> 13:45.950
Family restaurants are so fun.

13:46.033 --> 13:48.285
I've only been a few times.

13:48.369 --> 13:51.121
Really? Aren't there family restaurants
in every country?

13:51.205 --> 13:52.456
Are there?

13:53.249 --> 13:56.835
<i>We had most of our meals at home,
prepared by our chef.</i>

13:57.461 --> 13:58.587
Right.

13:58.671 --> 14:01.882
<i>I forgot she's the daughter
of a mafia boss.</i>

14:01.966 --> 14:05.302
You don't keep in touch
with people from back then?

14:07.638 --> 14:10.224
I like this relaxed life much better.

14:10.307 --> 14:13.602
I never really liked the mafia
to begin with.

14:13.686 --> 14:16.480
There's no way I could go back
to that world now.

14:16.564 --> 14:17.690
<i>Same here.</i>

14:17.773 --> 14:19.275
I know what you mean.

14:19.358 --> 14:21.944
Once you get a taste of peace,
you can't kick it.

14:22.653 --> 14:25.155
Well, I'm gonna go get another refill.

14:25.239 --> 14:26.282
ZHǍO DÀO NǏ LE

14:28.826 --> 14:29.994
QǏNG SǏ

14:45.801 --> 14:47.177
What can I get you?

14:47.261 --> 14:48.470
One melon soda.

14:48.971 --> 14:50.264
Yes, sir.

14:54.393 --> 14:56.645
Aren't you a bit old for a melon soda?

14:56.729 --> 15:00.441
I guess you're a fatty but not a foodie.

15:00.524 --> 15:02.359
What's with this guy?

15:04.361 --> 15:07.740
Wait a minute... Are you Wutang?

15:08.824 --> 15:09.783
Wutang?

15:10.784 --> 15:14.830
It has been too long, my lady.

15:16.040 --> 15:18.959
Wutang, you were alive?

15:19.043 --> 15:20.628
Who the hell are you?

15:21.462 --> 15:22.880
- Older brother?
- No way!

15:22.963 --> 15:24.590
Just someone from the mafia.

15:25.966 --> 15:26.800
My lady,

15:27.301 --> 15:30.930
since the incident,
the Lu clan has been without a leader.

15:31.013 --> 15:32.973
Hey. Don't ignore me.

15:33.057 --> 15:36.977
Please come back as the head of the clan.

15:37.728 --> 15:38.729
Look at them.

15:38.812 --> 15:42.566
You shouldn't associate with inferior,
barbaric hit men like this.

15:42.650 --> 15:43.484
What was that?

15:44.068 --> 15:47.029
No way! I'm not going back to the mafia.

15:47.112 --> 15:49.823
Whoever wants to be the head can do it.

15:56.205 --> 15:57.873
<i>She's so cute!</i>

15:57.957 --> 15:59.833
Mr. Wutang! Are you alright, sir?

16:01.794 --> 16:03.796
Don't cry. Hold still.

16:04.463 --> 16:05.589
<i>Who is this guy?</i>

16:07.257 --> 16:09.718
This is Lu Wutang.

16:10.386 --> 16:12.513
- My lady! My lady.
<i>- I don't know why, but...</i>

16:12.596 --> 16:15.432
- My lady? My lady!
<i>- ...he's always been insanely clingy.</i>

16:15.516 --> 16:17.685
<i>He's a perverted, meddling consigliere.</i>

16:17.768 --> 16:18.602
<i>My lady!</i>

16:19.228 --> 16:20.938
What's a consigliere?

16:21.021 --> 16:22.606
An adviser to the mafia.

16:22.690 --> 16:23.774
<i>What an honor.</i>

16:23.857 --> 16:25.985
<i>My lady knew all this time</i>

16:26.068 --> 16:28.112
<i>that I was protecting her nearby.</i>

16:28.195 --> 16:30.072
<i>Whoa, this dude is out there.</i>

16:32.241 --> 16:35.202
I told you. I've left the mafia for good.

16:35.786 --> 16:38.455
I'm just a store clerk at Sakamoto's now.

16:39.289 --> 16:43.210
I see. So, to summarize,
I wish to take my lady back,

16:43.293 --> 16:46.463
but Taro Sakamoto, the legendary hit man,

16:47.172 --> 16:50.217
is standing in my way.

16:50.300 --> 16:52.011
What's that supposed to mean?

16:52.094 --> 16:54.138
If you want a fight, I'm your guy.

16:54.221 --> 16:55.597
Idiot.

16:55.681 --> 16:58.142
As if I would fight a hit man bare-handed!

16:58.934 --> 16:59.893
You're so far back!

16:59.977 --> 17:01.645
<i>A refreshing change.</i>

17:01.729 --> 17:05.899
I will fight you for my lady,
the mafia way.

17:05.983 --> 17:06.984
No, we won't.

17:07.526 --> 17:09.695
It's quicker for us just to crush you now.

17:09.778 --> 17:11.488
<i>I want to get this over with.</i>

17:11.572 --> 17:12.948
Don't worry.

17:13.532 --> 17:15.117
You'll get something out of it.

17:15.617 --> 17:16.744
Sakamoto.

17:17.286 --> 17:18.829
If you win this battle,

17:19.413 --> 17:23.250
I will give you information
on the person that put the bounty on you.

17:24.168 --> 17:25.544
How would you know?

17:26.712 --> 17:29.048
Don't underestimate the mafia's network.

17:29.965 --> 17:31.258
Mr. Sakamoto?

17:33.343 --> 17:35.554
I refuse. You can't have Lu.

17:35.637 --> 17:37.765
We'll get the information on our own.

17:37.848 --> 17:38.682
Huh?

17:40.434 --> 17:42.394
Deal. Let's do it.

17:43.479 --> 17:44.855
What the?

17:44.938 --> 17:47.733
If you lose,
you'll have to go back to the mafia.

17:47.816 --> 17:49.026
I know.

17:49.109 --> 17:52.863
But I'm a part of Sakamoto's now.

17:52.946 --> 17:56.909
If I can give Mr. Manager a leg up,
you bet I will.

18:01.455 --> 18:02.831
Come with me, then.

18:07.461 --> 18:08.962
<i>Give him a leg up?</i>

18:09.838 --> 18:12.299
<i>She makes it sound so sensual.</i>

18:16.553 --> 18:18.347
It's filthy here.

18:18.430 --> 18:20.182
Where are you taking us?

18:20.265 --> 18:21.809
Shut up and follow me.

18:33.987 --> 18:36.907
What does "the mafia way" mean, anyway?

18:36.990 --> 18:38.575
<i>I want to go home.</i>

18:39.284 --> 18:41.203
You two. Peasants.

18:41.286 --> 18:44.498
Your scruffy clothes will draw attention
where we're going.

18:44.581 --> 18:47.376
I've generously prepared this for you.
Get changed.

18:47.459 --> 18:48.418
FOR MY LADY

18:48.502 --> 18:50.170
My lady, you can change here.

19:06.103 --> 19:07.104
Perfect fit.

19:12.693 --> 19:13.527
Go in.

19:17.698 --> 19:20.534
This is a place citizens of the underworld
come to socialize.

19:21.326 --> 19:23.662
A place swirling with desire and money...

19:24.538 --> 19:26.123
An underground casino.

19:27.541 --> 19:28.584
Casino?

19:28.667 --> 19:29.585
Now I get it.

19:29.668 --> 19:32.796
I see.
Physical strength won't matter here.

19:36.592 --> 19:38.135
I know you're poor,

19:38.218 --> 19:41.013
so I've prepared 30 million yen in chips
for you to use.

19:41.805 --> 19:45.893
The team that makes more money wins.

19:45.976 --> 19:48.854
We'll meet up again here in two hours.

19:56.570 --> 19:57.571
Gambling...

19:58.238 --> 19:59.740
No need for concern, Lu.

19:59.823 --> 20:02.075
We have Shin, the mind-reader.

20:02.159 --> 20:04.536
Oh, yeah. Of course.

20:05.078 --> 20:07.456
If we read the minds
of the dealers and other guests,

20:07.539 --> 20:09.249
we'll win for sure!

20:09.833 --> 20:14.171
I don't even know the rules
of any casino games.

20:14.254 --> 20:15.923
- Me neither.
- What?!

20:16.006 --> 20:17.174
We're screwed!

20:17.257 --> 20:21.428
<i>Wutang may not be good at fighting,
but he's incredibly sharp.</i>

20:22.387 --> 20:24.139
<i>The Lu clan values martial arts,</i>

20:24.223 --> 20:28.268
<i>so to get to a leadership position
with intelligence alone is exceptional.</i>

20:30.354 --> 20:31.521
Amazing!

20:31.605 --> 20:34.858
That guy with the braid went all-in
in his first round and won!

20:34.942 --> 20:37.069
So that means... 90 million yen?

20:37.152 --> 20:38.654
He's tripled it already?

20:39.529 --> 20:42.074
I will get my lady back.

20:42.699 --> 20:44.826
I'll bet everything on it.

20:48.497 --> 20:50.874
WIN MORE THAN WUTANG AT THE CASINO!

22:21.715 --> 22:22.758
Damn it!

22:22.841 --> 22:25.969
Thanks to the Sakamotos, I'm out of a job!

22:26.053 --> 22:26.887
Mr. Tanaka,

22:26.970 --> 22:29.639
I think our only choice now
is to open a crepe stand.

22:29.723 --> 22:31.808
What? A crepe stand?

22:33.226 --> 22:35.020
Sounds like a plan!

22:35.604 --> 22:36.438
TANAKA CREPES

22:36.521 --> 22:38.523
<i>That was from caller Poopy Pants.</i>

22:38.607 --> 22:40.108
No one's buying our crepes.

22:40.192 --> 22:41.526
<i>Next, from caller Poopy Pants...</i>

22:41.610 --> 22:42.652
Poopy Pants.

22:42.736 --> 22:44.905
Seba, how about
you turn off that radio and--

22:44.988 --> 22:46.114
I'm hungry.

22:48.742 --> 22:49.701
That was perfect!

22:49.785 --> 22:52.704
I've always wanted to try this.

22:53.705 --> 22:56.291
Ooh, look. A crepe stand.

22:57.751 --> 22:58.794
Shall we get some?

22:58.877 --> 23:00.170
Let's get some!

23:00.921 --> 23:02.297
<i>That pink hair!</i>

23:03.215 --> 23:04.508
Hey, no fair!

23:04.591 --> 23:06.009
I gotta hide--

23:07.886 --> 23:10.305
Whoa, look at that.

23:11.389 --> 23:13.141
The crepe's floating!

23:14.142 --> 23:15.977
That's so cool!

23:16.061 --> 23:18.939
<i>This crepe stand has gone viral
for their floating crepes.</i>

23:19.022 --> 23:21.024
There's gotta be some sort of trick.

23:21.108 --> 23:23.193
As long as it tastes good, who cares?

23:23.276 --> 23:24.736
- Yum!
- How fascinating.

23:24.820 --> 23:25.821
Subtitle translation by: Yuka Kristi
